opposite sides, and I will surely crucify you all.\"","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":49,"sd":null},{"k":"26:50","t":"They said, \"No harm. Indeed, to our Lord we will return.","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":50,"sd":null},{"k":"26:51","t":"Indeed, we aspire that our Lord will forgive us our sins because we were the first of the believers.\"","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":51,"sd":null},{"k":"26:52","t":"And We inspired to Moses, \"Travel by night with My servants; indeed, you will be pursued.\"","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":52,"sd":null},{"k":"26:53","t":"Then Pharaoh sent among the cities gatherers","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":53,"sd":null},{"k":"26:54","t":"[And said], \"Indeed, those are but a small band,","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":54,"sd":null},{"k":"26:55","t":"And indeed, they are enraging us,","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":55,"sd":null},{"k":"26:56","t":"And indeed, we are a cautious society...\"","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":56,"sd":null},{"k":"26:57","t":"So We removed them from gardens and springs","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":57,"sd":null},{"k":"26:58","t":"And treasures and honorable station -","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":58,"sd":null},{"k":"26:59","t":"Thus. And We caused to inherit it the Children of Israel.","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":59,"sd":null},{"k":"26:60","t":"So they pursued them at sunrise.","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":60,"sd":null}],"juz":19,"hizb":37,"surahs":[26],"sajdah":false}